MODULE: FencedOrdinaryApplied
TARGET: NoFencedRegression
CLASS: Action
SUMMARY: an already-reflected ordinary write overwrites the flushed batch during replay
PERTURBS: Read

--- FIND
                            Log[i].op = "ordinary" /\ Log[i].k = k /\ i > armed
--- REPLACE
                            Log[i].op = "ordinary" /\ Log[i].k = k
--- END
